1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,700
Arise, the children of the Fatherland,

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:08,000
The day of glory has arrived!

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Against us, of tyranny

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
The blood-stained standard is raised,

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
The blood-stained standard is raised!

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Do you hear, in the countryside,

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Those roars of the blood-thirsty soldiers?

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,000
They are coming right into your arms

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:37,000
To cut the throats of your sons, your wives!

10
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:41,000
To arms, citizens,

11
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Form your battalions,

12
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Let's march, let's march!

13
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,700
May impure blood

14
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:57,000
Water our furrows!

15
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:02,000
To arms, citizens,

16
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Form up your battalions,

17
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Let's march, let's march!

18
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:14,000
May impure blood

19
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Water our furrows!